OL,3,GNEWSAYoung swans injured in suspected
OL,4,Acatapult attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive young swans have been left injured
OL,7,Fafter reportedly being shot at by
OL,8,Fsomeone using a catapult and ball
OL,9,Fbearing.
OL,11,FThe attack on the cygnets was believed
OL,12,Fto have happened between 19:00 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday and 14:00 on Sunday on the
OL,14,FChesterfield Canal, around Browns Lock,
OL,15,Fin Rotherham, according to South
OL,16,FYorkshire Police.
OL,18,FThey were taken to a rescue centre for
OL,19,Ftreatment, where two remained in a
OL,20,Fserious condition and three others were
OL,21,Frecovering well, a force spokesperson
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
