OL,3,GNEWSAYoung swans injured in suspected
OL,4,Acatapult attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers urged anyone with information
OL,7,Fabout what happened, or who had seen
OL,8,Fanyone acting suspiciously in the area
OL,9,Fat the time, to get in touch.
